  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El restaurant Ca Vicent, en el Carme d&#39;Onda, ha acollit aquest dissabte la I jornada Comprom&iacute;s per l&#39;educaci&oacute;. De mat&iacute; s&#39;ha constitu&iuml;t tres grups de treball i de vesprada ha hagut una confer&egrave;ncia d&#39;Arcadi Oliveres, president de Just&iacute;cia i Pau.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9519.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Despr&eacute;s de la confer&egrave;ncia s&#39;ha celebrat una taula redona sobre L&#39;educaci&oacute; que volem, en la qual han participat tres expertes en educaci&oacute; i tamb&eacute; el representant de Comprom&iacute;s al Congr&eacute;s dels Diputats, Joan Baldov&iacute; Roda, que apareix en l&#39;&uacute;ltima foto de la galeria d&#39;imatges, a l&#39;esquerra, just abans de comen&ccedil;ar.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaondacompromiseducacio/comencamentjornadaondacompromiseducacio.jpg\" alt=\"comencamentjornadaondacompromiseducacio\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaondacompromiseducacio/img_9309.jpg\" alt=\"img_9309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaondacompromiseducacio/img_9310.jpg\" alt=\"img_9310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaondacompromiseducacio/img_9311.jpg\" alt=\"img_9311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaondacompromiseducacio/img_9312.jpg\" alt=\"i